Serhan Dagtas: In other institutions as well.

1021
02:14:12.840 --> 02:14:17.310
Serhan Dagtas: So there are other questions like conflicts of interest, benefits and risks.

1022
02:14:17.810 --> 02:14:19.780
Serhan Dagtas: And

1023
